# The runner image's build context needs ONLY the pinned hive source snapshot
# (hive-src.tar, generated by harness/build_runner.sh). Exclude everything else —
# runs/ alone is 13GB. Start by excluding all, then re-include the one artifact.
*
!hive-src.tar
# The entrypoint is a real file (COPYed, not printf'd) so tests can execute its
# dispatch logic directly — see test_packaged_runner_entrypoint_honors_both_command_protocols.
!hb-entrypoint.sh
